Subject: [PATCH 3/3] porter: adopt the newer ternary optimisation commits from
 CraneBW/ninfer-ternary-bonsai-ada (same Ambolio v1.0.8 base).\n\nAdopted (10
 modified + 1 new):\n- src/ops/linear/ternary/: rotation, gemm, gemv, small-T
 tensor-core paths, new ternary_rowsplit_mma.cuh\n-
 src/ops/gdn_gating_proj/bf16/bf16_gdn_gating_proj_kernels.cu: explicit lambda
 capture of\n  kTunedResidentCtasPerSm. VS 18 (MSVC 14.51) rejects the
 implicit capture with C3493, which is\n  what broke the previous run; the
 porter added the capture for GCC and it fixes MSVC too.\n-
 src/ops/linear_attention/gated_delta_net/recurrent.{cu,cuh},
 src/ops/linear_topk/q4_m64.cu\n\nCI: build step now passes '-k 0' to ninja so
 one run reports every compile error instead of the first.

